---
// src/components/Lifecycle.astro
---
<section id="lifecycle" class="py-24 bg-white border-y border-brand-100 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-brand-600 tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Sustainable By Design</h2>
      <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-brand-950 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Bagasse Products Lifecycle
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-800 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Discover the regenerative journey from composting soil back to premium, plastic-free tableware.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-8 items-stretch relative">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 top-1/2 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-brand-100 hidden md:block"></div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 text-center relative z-10 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 text-brand-600 mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <img src="/images/placeholder-soil.jpg" alt="Compost Soil Placeholder" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain" />
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Composting & Regeneration</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Biodegradable bagasse containers decompose, returning valuable nutrients to the soil.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 text-center relative z-10 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 text-brand-600 mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <img src="/images/placeholder-crops.jpg" alt="Sugarcane Crops Placeholder" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain" />
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Sugarcane Cultivation</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          New sugarcane crops grow vigorously, absorbing atmospheric CO2 and utilizing the regenerated soil.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 text-center relative z-10 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 text-brand-600 mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <img src="/images/placeholder-mill.jpg" alt="Sugar Mill Placeholder" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain" />
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Industrial Processing</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Stalks are crushed for juice (processed into different sugar products), leaving fibrous bagasse residue.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 text-center relative z-10 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 text-brand-600 mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <img src="/images/placeholder-pulping.jpg" alt="Pulping Placeholder" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain" />
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Pulping & Purification</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          The raw bagasse fiber is washed, purified, and transformed into a moldable, food-grade pulp.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 text-center relative z-10 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 text-brand-600 mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <img src="/images/placeholder-molding.jpg" alt="Molding Placeholder" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain" />
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Container Molding</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          The pulp is pressed under high heat and pressure into sturdy, plastic-free tableware.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>